Do not roll back below this release once clients use the post-quantum MLS cipher suites. Older brig versions cannot read ML-DSA client keys (`mldsa44`, `mldsa65`, `mldsa87`), so client lookups for affected users fail. Older galley versions cannot read conversations or subconversations that use any cipher suite from 0xF001 to 0xF00B, including the ones with classical signature keys. During a rolling upgrade, old instances also fail requests involving these cipher suites or signature schemes.
